<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Portal - Account Verification Email</title>
    <style>
        {{CSS_CONTENT}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-card">
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>🎓 University of Kelaniya</h1>
            <p>Campus Services Portal — Registrar Verification Office</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-body">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #0f2c59; font-size: 18px;">Account Email Verification</h2>
                {{STATUS_BADGE}}
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0;">Dear <strong>{{FULL_NAME}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>Welcome to the University Campus Services Portal! Your account registration has been processed against the Registrar Master List records.</p>

            <table class="meta-table">
                <tr>
                    <td style="color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; width: 140px;">Student Index No:</td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 700; color: #0f2c59;">{{INDEX_NUMBER}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">Registered Email:</td>
                    <td style="font-weight: 600;">{{REGISTERED_EMAIL}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">Faculty Unit:</td>
                    <td>{{FACULTY_NAME}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>To activate your portal login and complete account setup, please enter your single-use verification token:</p>

            <div class="token-box">
                <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 700;">Single-Use Activation Token</div>
                <div class="token-code">{{TOKEN}}</div>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">⏰ This single-use verification token is valid until: <strong>{{EXPIRES_STR}}</strong>.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569;">If you did not initiate this registration request, please disregard this message or notify the IT Helpdesk.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-footer">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Campus Services Portal — University Registrar Office</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">This is an automated system dispatch. Please do not reply directly to this email address.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
